OL,3,ASchool's strict rules led to boy's
OL,4,Adeath - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school's strict rules contributed to
OL,7,Fthe suicide of a 15-year-old boy and
OL,8,Fthere is a risk of future deaths, a
OL,9,Fcoroner had concluded.
OL,11,FAn inquest at Exeter Coroner's Court
OL,12,Fheard Taylor Lee, a pupil at Ivybridge
OL,13,FCommunity College, Devon, part of
OL,14,FWestcountry Schools Trust, took his own
OL,15,Flife in November 2023.
OL,17,FArea coroner Alison Longhorn ruled the
OL,18,Fcause of Lee's death was suicide, but
OL,19,Falso concluded he struggled with what
OL,20,Fhe perceived as unfair school
OL,21,Fsanctions.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
